msgstr "[Geringe Chance, zusätzlich 1 SCHADEN zu verursachen.]"

msgctxt "woh_small:516"
msgid "FOREST NOTE"
msgstr "NOTIZ AUS DEM WALD"

msgctxt "woh_small:517"
msgid ""
"I write this for everyone wanting to stay behind.\n"
"\n"
"The sacrifice is worth it.\n"
"Life's meaning comes from our relationships.\n"
"Share death, and that connection will outlast you.\n"
"\n"
"There won't be anything left but US."
msgstr ""
"Ich schreibe das für alle, die zurückbleiben wollen.\n"
"\n"
"Das Opfer ist es wert.\n"
"Der Sinn des Lebens liegt in unseren Beziehungen.\n"
"Wenn ihr den Tod teilt, wird diese Verbindung euch überdauern.\n"
"\n"
"WIR ALLEIN bleiben übrig."

msgctxt "woh_small:518"
msgid ""
"Everyone here is waiting for you so if you lose your resolve\n"
"\n"
"just listen to the VOICE OF HUMANITY"
msgstr ""
"Alle warten auf euch, also verzagt nicht, sondern\n"
"\n"
"lauscht der STIMME DER MENSCHHEIT."

msgctxt "woh_small:519"
msgid "GOBLET (BLOOD)"
msgstr "KELCH (BLUT)"

msgctxt "woh_small:520"
msgid ""
"[constantly cold to the touch]\n"
"(use): drink the blood"
msgstr ""
"[Fühlt sich immer kalt an.]\n"
"(verwenden): Blut trinken"

msgctxt "woh_small:521"
msgid "It looks ancient. What was it doing in school?..."
msgstr "Sieht uralt aus. Was hat er in der Schule verloren …?"

msgctxt "woh_small:522"
msgid "The blood drunk from the goblet is surprisingly cold and smooth."
msgstr "Das Blut aus dem Kelch ist überraschend kalt und lecker."

msgctxt "woh_small:523"
msgid "It rejuvenates you and clears your mind. (+6 STAMINA / +6 REASON)"
msgstr "Es erfrischt dich und du bekommst deinen Kopf frei. (+6 AUSDAUER / +6 VERNUNFT)"

msgctxt "woh_small:524"
msgid "BOTTLE [BLOOD]"
msgstr "FLASCHE [BLUT]"

msgctxt "woh_small:525"
msgid ""
"(use): drink the blood\n"
"[filled with boiling blood]"
msgstr ""
"(verwenden): Blut trinken\n"
"[Mit kochendem Blut gefüllt.]"

msgctxt "woh_small:526"
msgid "OCCULT DIARY"
msgstr "OKKULTES TAGEBUCH"

msgctxt "woh_small:527"
msgid "(use): -3% DOOM"
msgstr "(verwenden): -3 % VERDERBEN"

msgctxt "woh_small:528"
msgid "You burn the cursed diary. (-3% DOOM)"
msgstr "Du verbrennst das verfluchte Tagebuch. (-3 % VERDERBEN)"

msgctxt "woh_small:529"
msgid "RITUAL MASK (PUMPKIN)"
msgstr "KÜRBISMASKE"

msgctxt "woh_small:530"
