"(use): cook and eat it\n"
"[small chance of ignoring REASON loss in combat]"
msgstr ""
"(verwenden): Maske kochen und essen.\n"
"[Geringe Chance, im Kampf VERNUNFT-Verlust zu ignorieren.]"

